<http://data.silknow.org/object/fd77034f-0005-377b-965d-6d1701399f8f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of brocaded silk, Iran, 1800-1850"@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk. Warp-faced plain weave ground.\nWarp: red silk, possibly Z twist\nWeft: silk: red, white, dark grey, green, light blue, dark blue, pink, indeterminable twist\n\nMetal thread: silver strip S-wound on a yellow silk core, indeterminable twist; both open and closed winding.\nRed ground with an incomplete design: there is one row with three isolated floral plants.  The outer pair are in grey and white with a pink bud and the central one is in dark and light blue with a white bud, all with green leaves and edged in yellow.  In between each plant there is a facing butterfly in similar colours and at the  base of each plant there is an opposed butterfly in either pink and green or white and green."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/8a5e5c09-7791-38ad-8647-0850ef4eef64> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f253e10e-56a0-32d3-8ef6-c40b9537d05e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/2d9b6bb5-27f0-32fa-acf7-b7c1ccc42d3e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of brocaded silk, Iran, 1800-1850"@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk. Warp-faced plain weave ground.\nWarp: red silk, possibly Z twist\nWeft: silk: red, white, dark grey, green, light blue, dark blue, pink, indeterminable twist\n\nMetal thread: silver strip S-wound on a yellow silk core, indeterminable twist; both open and closed winding.\nRed ground with an incomplete design: there is one row with three isolated floral plants.  The outer pair are in grey and white with a pink bud and the central one is in dark and light blue with a white bud, all with green leaves and edged in yellow.  In between each plant there is a facing butterfly in similar colours and at the  base of each plant there is an opposed butterfly in either pink and green or white and green."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/fd77034f-0005-377b-965d-6d1701399f8f/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/fd77034f-0005-377b-965d-6d1701399f8f/dimension/2> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.21:15-1955" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O153860> .

